{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_137_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_137","textTraditional":"一、五年，春王正月，〈木巳〉叔姬來歸。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_137_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_137","textTraditional":"二、仲孫蔑如宋。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_137_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_137","textTraditional":"三、夏，叔孫僑如會晉荀秀于穀。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_137_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_137","textTraditional":"四、梁山崩。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_137_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_137","textTraditional":"梁山者何？河上之山也。梁山崩，何以書？記異也。何異爾？大也。何大爾？梁山崩，壅河三日不沐。外異不書，此何以書？為天下記異也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_137_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_137","textTraditional":"五、秋大水。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_137_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_137","textTraditional":"六、冬十有一月己酉，天王崩。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_137_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_137","textTraditional":"七、十有二月己丑，公會晉侯、齊侯、宋公、衞侯、鄭伯、曹伯、邾婁子、〈木巳〉伯同盟于蟲牢。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}